AC1 not resolved: font-family under "body" [policy] `font-family` under "body" was not resolved: the style suite refuses `font-family` as a discriminator on purpose, because Chrome injects `font-family: "Segoe UI"` into a `chrome-extension://` document and a reading on it passes on a pane with no typography of its own — so this record states the absence rather than writing a value the browser would not agree with
